  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The concealed shoe index is kept at the Northampton Museum and Art Gallery. If you find a concealed shoe or know about the discovery of one, then we would like to hear from you. All information provided will help us to explore this phenomenon further. Please email&nbsp;<a href="mailto:museums@westnorthants.gov.uk" target="_blank">museums@westnorthants.gov.uk</a>&nbsp;or click the link below:</p></div>


  
