    </span>
  
  <span class="author-name">Rebecca Shawcross</span>
</a>
<div class="author-bio"><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rebecca-shawcross-68902010/?originalSubdomain=uk" rel="nofollow noopener">Rebecca Shawcross</a> is the Senior Shoe Curator at<a href="https://www.northamptonmuseums.com/" rel="nofollow noopener"> Northampton Museums and Art Gallery</a>. She is responsible for the Designated Shoe Collection, which includes collections management, exhibitions, research and enquiries, talks and advising other museums and the media. She is interested in concealed footwear, the shoe industry in Northampton and shoes and identity. Her book Shoes: An Illustrated History was published by Bloomsbury in 2014 with a revised second issue out in 2022.</p></div>


